# Always Check for Similar File when Creating a New File

- When creating a new file, always check the codebase for that file or something similar to ensure that you need to create instead of edit or vice versa.

# Always Check for Similar Files when Editing a File

- When editing a file, always check the codebase for that file or something similar to ensure that you need to edit instead of create or vice versa.
